    "explanation": "Both sides largely agree on the facts, and the record supports a small refund to the rider. The trip was 11.18 km on the GPS trace against a booked optimal of 8.2 km — an excess of 2.98 km, or 36.3%. That clears both POL-RD-01 gates (more than 0.8 km and more than 20% of optimal), so a route deviation is established, as both advocates accept. It is not a MATERIAL deviation, because it is below both the 50% line and the 8.0 km line, so no POL-RD-06 conduct review or pattern uplift arises; the driver's profile in any event shows zero deviation flags against 553 completed trips. The deviation is fully excused. LTA advisory ADV-20260714-031 records an emergency closure of Braddell Road (towards Serangoon) between Lorong 1 Toa Payoh and Bishan Rd — the very arterial the platform's optimal route uses — from 05:30 to 12:00 on 14 July, overlapping the trip window. The vehicle left that corridor before the closed segment and rejoined it after, taking the CTE exactly as the advisory contemplates. Under POL-RD-03 the justified excess is min(2.98, 1.30 × (10.6 − 8.2) + 1.00) = min(2.98, 4.12) = 2.98 km, which absorbs the whole measured excess. The distance and time charges therefore stand, and there is no POL-RD-02 refund on them. What does not stand is the ERP. Because the detour is excused as an external closure, POL-RD-09(2) refunds the off-route gantry charges to the rider: the two CTE gantries of SGD 3.00 (08:14) and SGD 1.00 (08:19), both marked on_optimal_route false and both matched to the trace within 0 m and 40 m respectively — real crossings of a corridor the booked route never used, so no billing-integrity referral under POL-RD-09(4) arises. That is SGD 4.00, within the SGD 12.00 per-trip cap. The driver's chat message 'braddell close today, i take CTE ah' and the rider's 'ok' show the rider had notice and did not object, but the initiative was the driver's, not a rider instruction, so POL-RD-04 is not engaged and nothing reduces the ERP correction. Outcome: PARTIAL_REFUND of SGD 4.00; the balance of the contested amount stands. Confidence is high — every artifact relied on carries full weight (1.0) and the trace is unbroken (175 fixes, 10 s interval, no gaps), so no escalation or referral is required.",
